        <p>Bracketed figures in the sections above are from these sources. Every number the builder gave on camera is his, from the video; every number beside it is from the paper, the regulators, the chip and parts makers, the projects' own pages or The Markup, and the two are never added together. Conversions and ratios, an eighth of a watt or 610 metres, are worked from them.</p>
